<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Economic Stabler</title>

  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #111;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      background: #222;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 36px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #ddd;
    }

    .content {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 40px 20px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 14px 25px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      background: #0a8f2c;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 25px;
      background: #222;
      color: #aaa;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>ECONOMIC STABLER</h1>
    <p>Financial education and economic information</p>
  </header>

  <div class="content">
    <h2>Welcome</h2>

    <p>
      Welcome to Economic Stabler, a platform focused on
      financial education and economic information.
    </p>

    <p>
      Explore useful information and resources to help you
      make more informed financial decisions.
    </p>

    <a class="button" href="#information">Learn More</a>
  </div>

  <div class="content" id="information">
    <h2>Financial Information</h2>
    <p>
      We provide educational content about saving, budgeting,
      retirement planning and general economic topics.
    </p>
  </div>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Economic Stabler
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
